{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Iridium Rod is a ",["l","工具","tool"]," used to catch ",["l","鱼","fish"],". It can be purchased from ",["l","鱼店","Willy's Fish Shop"]," for 7,500g after reaching ",["l","技能","Fishing level 6"],". It can have both ",["l","鱼饵","bait"]," and ",["l","渔具","tackle"]," attached to it."]]]],["Secret",2,[["d","Details",[["p",["Putting ",["l","彩蛋","Lucky Purple Shorts"]," in the tackle slot of a fishing rod changes the ",["l","鱼店","bobber style"]," to a unique Lucky Purple Shorts bobber. This cannot be done with Trimmed Lucky Purple Shorts."]]]]]]]}